back---so the load-bearing entries are layers 8 and 12, a third of the way into
the network, where the receiver has already processed eight or twelve blocks'
worth of filler in those positions and the transplant still recovers
everything. Past layer 14 a single layer's worth stops being enough: $0.400$ at
