the span at \emph{every} layer at once returns it to $0.950$, so what fails past
layer 14 is the handover at one depth, not the mechanism.

The one non-monotonicity, $0.250$ at layer 18 against $0.475$ at 20, has
overlapping intervals at $n=40$ and we do not interpret it.

